.Dd September 2026
.Dt HELLO 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm hello
.Nd simple hello world program
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Fl V
.Op Fl n Ar name
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
is a simple program written in C that prints a familiar, friendly greeting to stdout.

.Sh OPTIONS

.Bl -tag -width Ds

.It Fl n Ar name
specify
.Ar name
as the name in the greeting.

the default name is
.Ql World .

.It Fl V
print the
.Nm
version and exit.

.El

.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr stdio 3 ,
.Xr string 3 

